            total += occ[i] * occ[j] * exp(-(x ** 6)) * (ei - ej) ** 2 / d
    return float(0.5 * total / z) if z > 0 and valid > 0 else nan"},{"description":"Root-mean-square electronegativity difference across smooth short-range contacts.","name":"contact_electronegativity_rms","source":"def feature(s):
