    return float(total / weight) if weight > 0 else nan"}],"notes":"Six-angstrom truncation can underestimate coordination in open structures; covalent radii and neutral-atom charge-transfer costs are proxies, not oxidation-state assignments.","queries":[{"include_any":["Be","Hf","Th","Rh","Tm","Tb","Ir","Np","Pm","Pa"],"n":25},{"include_any":["F","Cl","Br"],"n":25,"n_elements":[2,4]},{"exclude":["O","F","Cl","Br","I"],"include_any":["Rb","Cs","Ba","Ca"],"n":25,"n_elements":[3,5]}],"rationale":"Adds occupancy-aware packing, coordination, contact chemistry and local geometry beyond Magpie; sampling covers sparse elements, halides and electropositive mixtures."}

