    return value / total if total > 0 else 0.0"}],"notes":"Covalent radii and neutral-atom transfer gaps are chemical proxies, not oxidation-state assignments; the 6 Å neighbor cutoff censors open environments.","queries":[{"include_any":["Be","Hf","Sc","Th","Rh","Tm","Pt"],"n":25},{"include_any":["F","Cl","Br"],"n":25,"n_elements":[2,4]},{"include_all":["O"],"include_any":["P","Nb","Sn","W","Tl"],"n":25,"n_elements":[3,5]}],"rationale":"Packing, first-shell chemistry and angular order complement Magpie; queries emphasize sparse elements, halides and complex oxides."}

