    return float(4.188790204786391 * total / (weight * v)) if weight > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Mean occupied-neighbor count within 1.20 times each site's nearest-neighbor distance.","name":"adaptive_nearest_shell_coordination","source":"def feature(s):
