            amount += occ[i]
    return float(total / amount) if amount > 0 else 0.0"},{"description":"Per-atom positive coordination shortfall from octet-rule bond-count references for hydrogen and light p-block sites.","name":"light_atom_coordination_deficit","source":"def feature(s):
