    return 4.188790204786391 * total / (max(weight, 1e-12) * volume)"},{"description":"Fraction of near-covalent contacts that are homonuclear with electronegativity at least 2.4.","name":"electronegative_homonuclear_contact_fraction","source":"def feature(s):
