    mean = first / weight
    return max(0.0, second / weight - mean * mean) ** 0.5 / mean"},{"description":"Excess homonuclear soft-contact fraction relative to composition-random mixing, normalized by available heteronuclear fraction.","name":"chemical_contact_assortativity","source":"def feature(s):
