    return total / max(sum(occ), 1e-12)"}],"notes":"Distance-derived bond orders and octet balances are geometric proxies, not oxidation states; new bond-order terms omit missing radii and count periodic images within 6 Å.","queries":[{"exclude":["O","F","N"],"include_all":["P"],"n":20},{"include_all":["O"],"include_any":["Re","Sc","W","Tc","Cu","Mn"],"n":30,"n_elements":[3,5]},{"exclude":["O","F","N","P"],"include_any":["B","Ir","Re","Os","Hf","Ta","Nb","Pt"],"n":25,"n_elements":[2,5]}],"rationale":"Retain the 18 working descriptors and add multiple-bond density and bond-compensated octet balance; sample remaining phosphides, mixed-metal oxides, and underrepresented refractory chemistries."}

